		(descr "DOWO RCLAMP0524P DFN2510-10L, 2.5x1.0 mm body, pitch 0.5 mm. Dimensions from DOWO datasheet Rev.G1.00 (2024/03/01) p.4: D 2.5, E 1.0, lead width b 0.20, GND lead b1 0.40, lead length L 0.38. Land: signal pads 0.28 wide, GND pads 0.42 wide, 0.55 long (toe 0.16 mm). Pins 3 and 8 = GND, 1/2/4/5 = I/O, 6/7/9/10 = NC (datasheet p.1-2). The datasheet gives no land pattern: this land is derived from the outline, see docs/ESD_footprint_check.md")
